#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:5
#: 28aad56563c146e1ae428b4293141e15 2dd1044a95434ae086632268cf46fe1b
#: 3dcf143b290c420385d30217a3827a9c 6c25a942050d4a2485b7f25458e5c9c7
#: 7aecb1d20c7142bf933cbaa780459dc0 890c7b70dae44b2ba4a6aab05f14d40b
#: 9fcc694a41ef4a679656893539b2afc7 d2fb6b652cb245b1986f7f5698131588
msgid "Accelerometer Calibration"
msgstr "加速度计校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:9
#: 01b9f986b7c6431a80222b6e706d45cb 1309412adad1420d9db953925b0d3fa9
#: 52f2e6353dbe49d5b17f8a704f6ad496 75b6767416f54b1a8c6fbd1c24e3bfed
#: 8a3d8a6fc07f48d1b7e962f1d6bd9d1a a9a7361dbe384c0e8128cf58ab091fa4
#: ed06e058ddc946c3a5074daafea37105 ef7f0969865b4b26b1d637c9d26095b1
msgid ""
"This article shows how to perform basic accelerometer calibration (using "
"*Mission Planner*). The accelerometers in the autopilot must be calibrated "
"to correct for their bias offsets in all three axes, as well as any off-axis"
" variations."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何使用 *Mission Planner* 进行基本的加速度计校准。飞控中的加速度计必须进行校准，以纠正三轴上的零偏误差以及各轴间的偏差。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:14
#: 36f6580f0e664da1a95d8fb986eeca09 455f3b84b6b44fa88a09a4d49720e248
#: 52d1edb62c804cb3aaabdab42cef4130 5f017c0461ce4cb3bcd51660dd759c09
#: 78dce47c64da487a8e569c021f60d400 9565cec3f47c49bb9cfc7de85f844aeb
#: 95807e5cc06b4981ac026ed4c0b9cc00 f893e36794b244a490dca39db4f8da7e
msgid "Accelerometer calibration is mandatory in ArduPilot."
msgstr "加速度计校准在 ArduPilot 中是必须执行的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:18
#: 4e52e97cb0874b40ae995219358a4ad0 55848a3b043040f1995244aee09b9ae5
#: 7ff17343db614afaa2fe43d5d62b230a 846b151e42b94389a0f62b331541d374
#: 96b773534b9c464ba4f7e15f0c43b7ee cccfc0797f7f4d7694e73ee3cb4f3b66
#: ceb76018553844a288de51737c9bdbf0 fa7384257fc7427fac3fcc7020e47ba4
msgid ""
"Accelerometer calibration cannot be performed while the vehicle is armed."
msgstr "飞行器解锁状态下无法进行加速度计校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:21
#: 098dcfd4b3334cb49080a1a1d0575dd4 0ef8dfd2299b484db4558c4e25db7047
#: 14d9c546c4484886bec08e958d4b13cc 3084334f8a954eedaeac75d0262a6696
#: 30f21c4ae59648b9be7ea1a2c8a670f8 532315b725a44729b5dc78a8772202d1
#: 926649c4404d45c39af6e3da50ff2905 d7c8f5493e68466aad0ec75a42f08a04
msgid "Calibration steps"
msgstr "校准步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:23
#: 142cb500043d41758c5d0a577c55d348 1561d00d4bbc4cd2a585d0e2edc439e3
#: 5ed0d0f7f03c4ee19fb0b1e9aaf5b10c 8bf387b552f943bc971d8e77eb6507a7
#: 952e1de654ae494ab43a76240b5fac30 b76b18cdec0a465c97ce61a9e016b271
#: d6f26f75c2394a81a5e4d5b2bf772a97 de67812cdbe14d05a6365bdf1305e4e5
msgid ""
"If the board is mounted in a non-standard orientation (i.e. arrow is not "
"pointing forward) then please ensure the "
":ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>`  is properly set before doing the "
"accelerometer calibration."
msgstr ""
"若飞控以非标准方向安装（即箭头不朝前），请在进行加速度计校准之前确保 :ref:`AHRS_ORIENTATION<AHRS_ORIENTATION>`"
" 已正确设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:25
#: 3bdcd9dcd84e495f86cc8ffbb2476312 42f6d8dcc82d4ab2aeff624047d279e8
#: 673b6413524c4cefbc6c35c255fb48a1 72be1b39ebdf4b35a70e60deb3472413
#: 83ebd4c3656e4e54ab1fe5b94fddcf62 905456da32af47f590bcf28e6f75c441
#: a9fdb13e902c420b977563ed118853ad d5560ba065ba432f851ede4914cbf3d3
msgid ""
"For very large vehicles, this may be done on the bench, after the "
"orientation is set for how it will be mounted in the vehicle and the "
"calibration orientations are done as fit in the vehicle. Then be sure to use"
" the **Calibrate Level** step in the following instructions once mounted."
msgstr ""
"对于大型飞行器，可在工作台上完成校准，前提是方向已按实际安装方向设置，并按适合飞行器的姿势完成各校准方向。安装完成后，请务必按照以下说明执行 "
"**Calibrate Level** 步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:27
#: 067ec0dcfe274d8996f5f60e637ed800 1de0d3d9626644b9b5e3818d8235284f
#: 407170a6d7b74e27ac5cc06dc0fc9058 4c705c299133424cbe9f279f81efc389
#: 71bce7909135490c853c0e3678354aaf 881ce8b053fe4c00bb26ebafac1fee39
#: d1eeff6ad2434610a312e43299b17a4f dc57bd52cb324a8dae999182a28d6087
msgid ""
"Under **Setup \\| Mandatory Hardware**, select **Accel Calibration** from "
"the left-side menu."
msgstr "在 **Setup \\| Mandatory Hardware** 下，从左侧菜单选择 **Accel Calibration**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:32
#: 3cfda88454bd434da1007e82f71d3b13 43dad925bb0f4149a625ca124c4586cc
#: 50afdca5184d4f2085c11224d3bd99ac 621f190dd420459a8299ae6fe32fdc29
#: a35ab74d9a674f0faef88ff24a01f07e ca756604ee9040819323a138cd7ce7a7
#: cde2258fe2e943348e6ecef1b900e79e e703cffd799946f288cd391e0b941366
msgid "Mission Planner: Calibrate Acceleration"
msgstr "Mission Planner：校准加速度计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:34
#: 120a756ad90643feaca7e87ad583ff3f 4c6484d5049644d494ad46fd39089f1f
#: 688deb7c4a6147cb851b8af14818a2eb 98618455c651433eb6965ca9063888f1
#: b2695e9fcb1b47a2aed6ea02e80d195e e6580e42f72b4ba98e7828d7e0768203
#: f7c875ffc79142c6a721c701f9b1317f fb0db0dafc744428ae5d20c17a3c55ca
msgid "Click **Calibrate Accel** to start the full 3-axis calibration."
msgstr "点击 **Calibrate Accel** 开始完整的三轴校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:36
#: 06140b6c2d684fa2b3a2bc597c2618f1 101bc52ffefb4e7b8d02414017486dac
#: 6810b21206a84f1094cf6fd4d597ab81 96ff8f5951884f0a8d16cee76226f16f
#: 9a3cd498dcb34945bad02c751f70c514 9aeb07912fc6428e9edef91330e59645
#: a18542214403434e9d10c5a0a76308a5 f3a99e62c4264169a562abb99fc9bf93
msgid ""
"*Mission Planner* will prompt you to place the vehicle on each axis during "
"the calibration. Press any key to indicate that the autopilot is in position"
" and then proceed to the next orientation."
msgstr "*Mission Planner* 将提示您在校准过程中将飞行器放置于各个轴向。按任意键确认飞控已就位，然后继续下一个方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:38
#: 20cf4259ed0746378b215c5d26f40fda 332508cf627844168178bec827eafacd
#: 3ddb7c5346de42fc809b76917b0d1769 4fcb510d74884be59b9ffac9a1f4c0a2
#: 64fc13aad7e648789f6d10d6d29356df 95572364ae9b4524b694fabd1cd26243
#: f2571d9fc66244a8b25d5bba53aee443 ffce109a36024bfd9ef9d600d3ccc661
msgid ""
"The calibration positions are: level, right side, left side, nose down, nose"
" up, and on its back."
msgstr "校准位置包括：水平、右侧、左侧、机头朝下、机头朝上和倒置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:43
#: 0b776068494142ae8c1c7bbdfaea8fdd 15edcf1eef534ff6b679b35b8489bb4b
#: 4c2f60fd433e48dd806b0d5ac841c537 7c7593b9e131439cb9f75a497df6b1ba
#: 92db71c76b2548cfb4f6bf721c8caf3a 98e601ce990e4b1f96efeda2c9bab685
#: a2608fa12c064cbc8ff1665b9a1f279e e068e6cc404c4c68aa86e36fa43ba970
msgid "Accelerometer Calibration Positions (Copter)"
msgstr "加速度计校准位置（Copter）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:45
#: 207e5882b5714846bd1beacf237cef47 f79027bd3ac0498fb5dc9604c22924d4
msgid ""
"The vehicle must be kept still immediately after pressing the key for each "
"step. This is more important than getting the angle exactly right, ie. left "
"being 90deg to horizontal, etc. Except for the first \"LEVEL\", the "
"positions can be within 20 degrees of being exact. **Being still in each "
"position as you press the key is much more important.**"
msgstr ""
"每步按键后，飞行器必须立即保持静止。这比角度是否完全精确更为重要，例如左侧是否恰好呈 90 度水平等。除第一个「水平」位置外，其他位置可在精确值 20 "
"度范围内。**在按键时保持每个位置静止远比角度精确重要。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:47
#: 2386c4fb0b5a46bf8eae8fd296ab078a 2819fbaa4c0d4614838c15e907441dbb
#: 57129ddf6bd649a9a664d496594e65f2 6775199d9fa2464b91b4bdddd4b43aab
#: 6c09d29f001e4764b35f6f2ec26defbc a9130733d6b54530aa65ad014ffd4255
#: c8349ab2b9ad41348759d47919bad0a8 cb15c483ce9e4c778c87106fc0f56d9e
msgid "You should calibrate the board mounted in the vehicle if possible."
msgstr "如有可能，应将飞控安装在飞行器上后再进行校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:48
#: 09ff5fefee38428695db341d8fe6148c 10409e8e8b2c4839b627cbdfe315f07e
#: 21ae659b56fe43a68b046cf94ba14ef7 5185dfed6db34d77bc3cc68fd5c16906
#: 54faa287d08f48d696b31920fc801e51 8197a37cfad14bfb9425f1767dcca13a
#: 82c23606306142e5b664b440b7608a64 c5e0f5c39b874cba8b862aaa37fddae3
msgid ""
"However, you may need to calibrate the board before it is mounted if the "
"size/shape of the vehicle makes this difficult."
msgstr "但是，如果飞行器的尺寸/形状使此操作困难，则可能需要在安装前先对飞控进行校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:49
#: 0a152ed2b6f44286a1dc1d0a8366dfaa 3ac5a068ff714e73b9772523c45d6630
#: 63ace42f816a46699c76aae69bde5cdc 9d2b2a10eb454be790567d7e92bc5e90
#: d0a67aeaccbb4a92be11e221b16adfb2 dabd105a92c74ed092ddb13dfce308cd
#: f54086ae61d34889b6da1c32cad39019 fce33e1cf282434598aad19f5754541c
msgid ""
"The level position is the most important to get right as this will be the "
"attitude that your controller considers level while flying."
msgstr "水平位置最为重要，因为这将是飞控在飞行中认定为水平的姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:50
#: 2356e037dce74d7db12e2f0a83c23470 44b8d489e6cc43c48ecd4ab5a4e8f447
#: 53280c21cfe9487e9f8b8717fd6cd31e 7ac50db7219e44109a61628b9ccd604b
#: 85b5ee1fd03f4f20adc3b0b7808c457e a3562b341306426ba04092016a42dcc1
#: a3c549a4d11c473291c10b70c2108a98 c548ff46f8474ea7a381ad5de558b6d7
msgid ""
"You can recalibrate this Level position using Mission Planner after you have"
" installed the autopilot and are ready to fly. Place the vehicle in its "
"level flying attitude and use the **Calibrate Level** button."
msgstr ""
"安装飞控并准备飞行后，可以在 Mission Planner 中使用 **Calibrate Level** "
"按钮重新校准此水平位置。将飞行器保持在水平飞行姿态，然后点击该按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:52
#: 1114651ecc2c423388e26a8826c3cdc9 26a447b31ac744d4bb0d253623ab7a2e
#: 34826d40f4f64815aa3639472c339909 408490fba66441429438d757cc8362a1
#: 7f44c22d04e043598e51aab3023f4156 89f9d7ec70924e39a5fd08700fea0af7
#: bf68f10f37ce42cba30b40648eb80bde d0085a20480a4aa2ab5a3a7f66b265b1
msgid ""
"this **Calibrate Level** operation can only correct up to a 10 degree "
"difference between the initial calibration and the final position in the "
"vehicle, and only corrects pitch and roll differences, not yaw."
msgstr ""
"**Calibrate Level** 操作仅能纠正初始校准与飞行器实际安装位置之间不超过 10 度的差异，且仅纠正俯仰和横滚差异，不纠正偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:56
#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:63
#: 1915482f19674906a5d28cb9507a30df 1a9e3957a1874bbe989b7f3c92ae210d
#: 572849b3252144e488b1a1d9006a4387 81bce4a460ef4dd5963751195f30ec40
#: b3bf74f8ba1e4d1d8928182d0886dd1f ba5d169c5cb241f5af7f4831d27879f6
#: c36e88251dcd4ec4b4a043eb5d483db9 fe2eacdf8bfa47d0ba2052744a711b3a
msgid ""
"Proceed through the required positions, using the **Click when Done** button"
" once each position is reached and held still."
msgstr "依次完成所需位置，到达每个位置并保持静止后点击 **Click when Done** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:58
#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:65
#: 15ff78f4acac447c97d362749632332b 49ddd2057f9d4b97a79a90dd39759603
#: 4b8cfc18cde245c3838bb8745f5dd899 5ad32d5ec99547f2971858fdb5b4bf59
#: 97560c01b12e4f88bb731deb4cf497f8 9922267fb7ec491ba4b93214789920e2
#: d7dcea41b0714180b73b005d4519a496 e9556bb87a76419aa4b506eb19100525
msgid ""
"When you have completed the calibration process, Mission Planner will "
"display \"Calibration Successful!\" as shown below."
msgstr "完成校准过程后，Mission Planner 将显示「Calibration Successful!」，如下所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:63
#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:70
#: 0011cb275581410c8db06dd7dc5d8164 28fb0ba402bf4b90bd6925d87aecc18c
#: 3b2f73aab19c4f39b0411e24271157f6 794813a27e174e3a841516d8e475dbc6
#: 9b96d1cb6aef4c959eb88a50575cc2bf d0369251eaa149d5b491a4ad09862569
#: dd40fe11eb7f4dd88cac6b4905b67eee ecb8d46445754f4cac6394c65092a146
msgid "Mission Planner: Calibration Successful"
msgstr "Mission Planner：校准成功"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:65
#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:72
#: 1601b35f2ab5412f82cc48fd3f44cfd2 5b68e0de6a8e4c868b82e58a90499194
#: 5c7ecdd19d7d42ae9faf9acf6e2ff700 714b0c1f388c4ed3926986cf49936941
#: a32159802c9e4a3abf8f4030d23176f8 ac375ff7c32c4fd9955d032f6de2fabe
#: d9e78fb9a6474e51b5d937b0e2611b69 ee40c0db602948168b62bb0bb8360258
msgid ""
"If your autopilot has a built-in IMU heater, then it is recommended that the"
" :ref:`common-imutempcal` also be done. Some autopilots have this "
"calibration done at the factory in which case, this calibration need not be "
"done."
msgstr "若飞控内置 IMU 加热器，建议同时执行 :ref:`common-imutempcal`。部分飞控已在出厂时完成此校准，则无需再次校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:68
#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:75
#: 0b926e8371c242e8a7b0891233451f0f 415541faef774296a1f2b8e38d2c7107
#: 49460ece57184af2bf754b5d094f68d3 4d3637cddb9e4fa38bedf39eced582f6
#: 7a799c6bafc44545874108defe8741d5 926d9b934ab7446d83f2716dc94f8465
#: b09e1809ef2b4334a30e8878d839d788 e65909f8c0254262b3236c3389691167
msgid "Simple Calibration"
msgstr "简易校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:70
#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:77
#: 3f278f6f4c7a47e18f4c88f67d9f4749 4993863c62f041b6a00c0fa107330ea7
#: 630091119cc041ddbc94c07f47226ae6 688bfbd14a794fd3be717919a539b7b5
#: 745554efe9dc4dcca2e2a386cff745b7 77a3ac7eeba7406cbd76b4caf0b9930a
#: 8f79f070ee074c06a4e7b509d221e993 adcb822786034a769f6b347ff7e88b19
msgid ""
"Sometimes, for very large vehicles, it's not easy to do the full 3-axis "
"calibration. In this case, the **Simple Accel Cal** can be done with the "
"vehicle held still and in a level attitude. This only calibrates the main "
"offsets of the accelerometers, not the minor off-axis variations, so it's "
"not ideal in terms of optimal performance, but is sometimes an acceptable "
"compromise."
msgstr ""
"有时对于大型飞行器，完整的三轴校准并不容易进行。此时可在飞行器静止并保持水平姿态的情况下执行 **Simple Accel "
"Cal**。这仅校准加速度计的主要偏移量，而非次要轴间变化，因此性能不如全面校准理想，但有时是可接受的折中方案。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:72
#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:79
#: 1f1ec1f1a3ea4fbca52a96a3685dc6c2 2ce9cebe4da941c19408e4cd046d26fa
#: 2d322c8000f8409ba6bf22baa0b0abb6 a6099fc8cf7542f0956dc261d2993af8
#: c487fc4fca5f4471b1c112c827ac6789 c8ea71e0fd244cc5aed7a0d7090efc6b
#: d559298f85d94a4e9357527170e48042 f875d2a5c59044df861887aefb3d98b1
msgid ""
"This is **NOT** the same as the **Calibrate Level** function. To use that "
"function, either a full 3-axis or simple calibration must be done first!"
msgstr "这与 **Calibrate Level** 功能 **不同**。使用该功能前，必须先完成完整三轴校准或简易校准！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:75
#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:82
#: 16f014dfe2df4520a1f9bd27330b2159 1807b7e59697477c802e9a50b9657103
#: 48f719f2412a41728b89fa60005b991e 7adf60467e3a46539f6e1b58eef2f465
#: aa8d314045454a6485ce0d73fb6cc6ae c4af313816a0452186c1e80374851e83
#: f0486b08f6d34844a7b5cce073891c13 fde3aa8cc0294446900eba64fb1799bb
msgid "Video demonstration (Copter)"
msgstr "视频演示（Copter）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:77
#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:84
#: 284428da22734cde9af332a219fd55ce 463b2261267d403db767e76183a61245
#: 474255eecab942239f4dd20e0b0d43af 4f61ccbb438f4b3082646b7cf396d68c
#: 5352924bb5264ab89a28eda31a5cea10 6906dedb4b3e42178ad352e789547ad5
#: 96a735cbdcbc484e83d29a5a1c163cf7 e71a53028e0640dcbc38d56d593180fd
msgid ""
"Video demonstration of accelerometer calibration. This is for an older "
"version of Copter/Mission Planner, but is useful as an example of how you "
"might hold a Copter."
msgstr "加速度计校准视频演示。该视频适用于较旧版本的 Copter/Mission Planner，但可作为如何持握 Copter 的示例参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:55
#: 024da1d052c647f39cdedaf96d6a0cce 472869b29575406e93ae4816f4965389
msgid ""
"For planes, the \"level\" angle for pitch is important for steady altitude "
"flight. See :ref:`tuning-cruise` for more details."
msgstr "对于飞机，俯仰的「水平」角度对于稳定高度飞行非常重要。更多详情请参阅 :ref:`tuning-cruise`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:57
#: 3ac78dd32acb4a63a0a0d8baeb46a764 534c46194ffb498786ffd5815b6c052e
msgid ""
"The :ref:`STAB_PITCH_DOWN<STAB_PITCH_DOWN>` parameter will add \"nose-down\""
" trim when the throttle stick is lowered in pilot throttle controlled and "
"stabilized modes, such as FBWA, to prevent the autopilot from holding the "
"nose up as the plane slows down and potentially causing a stall. This can be"
" tested, at altitude, in FBWA mode by moving the throttle to idle and "
"checking that there is sufficient airspeed in a turn to avoid stalling. Be "
"prepared to recover from a stall! Increase the value of "
":ref:`STAB_PITCH_DOWN<STAB_PITCH_DOWN>`, if necessary."
msgstr ""
":ref:`STAB_PITCH_DOWN<STAB_PITCH_DOWN>` 参数会在飞手控制油门且处于稳定模式（如 "
"FBWA）时，在油门杆降低时添加「低头」微调，以防止飞控在飞机减速时保持机头抬高并可能导致失速。可以在高空的 FBWA "
"模式下通过将油门降至怠速并检查转弯时是否有足够空速来避免失速来测试这一点。要做好从失速中恢复的准备！如有必要，增大 "
":ref:`STAB_PITCH_DOWN<STAB_PITCH_DOWN>` 的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:59
#: 11531b68dffb45c6b915f8c6dfdd2081 93ea6839d3cd45e5af0e8c39869ac1ba
msgid ""
"For small planes or gliders, :ref:`STAB_PITCH_DOWN<STAB_PITCH_DOWN>` often "
"needs to be set more than the default value of 2 degrees."
msgstr "对于小型飞机或滑翔机，:ref:`STAB_PITCH_DOWN<STAB_PITCH_DOWN>` 通常需要设置得比默认值 2 度更大。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-accelerometer-calibration.rst:45
#: 308091aa842c45bc9e2e418f14ef83f8 36c5089b005446c49a7a8488b8c0abd1
#: 4a92ae24c00743a1aa3f8a5b9b8de087 75031b9cec8b4ae8b2a741e4cf07dff1
#: cfb39c4d3c9445af92681abc3ee7a34f d076b1e05ac447e3ae39c1b5c6fdd549
msgid ""
"The vehicle must be kept still immediately after pressing the key for each "
"step. This is more important than getting the angle exactly right, ie. left "
"being 90deg to horizontal, etc. Except for the first \"LEVEL\", the "
"positions can be within 20 degrees of being exact. **Being still in each "
"position as you press the key is much more important.**.  Do not hold the "
"vehicle when doing this step, find some way to pose the vehicle (e.g. lie on"
" the ground or put it in a jig)."
msgstr ""
"每一步按下按键后必须立即保持机体静止。这比角度精确更重要（例如向左侧放时是否恰好与水平面成 90 度等）。除第一个 "
"\"LEVEL\"（水平）姿态外，其余各姿态与准确位置相差 20 度以内即可。**按键时在每个姿态保持静止要重要得多。** "
"做这一步时不要用手扶着机体，设法将其摆放固定（例如放在地上或固定在夹具中）。"
